# welcome-reduced-loop (H10): route welcome under reduced motion. The page
# shows the still (sinx, a 3, k 0, b 1.48, h 1) with no frames: the two
# shots are identical, no loop-line change, and natively the app sleeps
# between them (the trace shows no frames).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
route welcome
wait 2000
shot loop-reduced-2000
wait 3000
shot loop-reduced-5000
